<div class="wrap page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Services</span><h1>Full renovations in Bologna</h1><p class="lead">We renovate apartments and houses on a turnkey basis. We handle all the work and the coordination, and you have one point of contact from start to finish.</p></div>
<section class="band white"><div class="wrap split">
  <div class="stack"><h2>What's included</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li>Demolition, waste removal and new partition walls</li>
      <li>New electrical and plumbing systems</li>
      <li>Screeds, floors and wall tiling</li>
      <li>Plasterboard, false ceilings, skimming and painting</li>
      <li>Complete bathrooms and kitchens</li>
      <li>New room layouts, even changing the entire floor plan</li>
      <li>New openings in load-bearing walls, with steel frames</li>
      <li>Windows turned into French doors</li>
      <li>Wood floors, including herringbone</li>
      <li>New windows and outdoor wooden decks</li>
      <li>Help with paperwork and tax deductions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Every home is different, so we always start with a site visit and give you a free, tailored quote.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/quote/">Ask for a free quote</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="stack">{{ ba(pia, L, 'en') }}<p class="cap">Full renovation of a house in Pianoro (BO): new floor plan, windows turned into French doors and a new front door opened in the load-bearing wall.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="band white" id="plasterboard"><div class="wrap split" style="align-items:center">
